						<p>As more crowns are fully automated, the designer’s job may shift from building every restoration to auditing what the model produced. This phone concept imagines that world: a lightweight companion for the queue, the case brief, and quick checks on automated work. It’s a thought experiment about scaling this system and changing the nature of design, not a roadmap item. There is no mobile Design Editor today. Sample data only.</p>
					</div>
